# Supabase migrations

When you add or change files under `supabase/migrations/` or materially update `supabase/schema.sql`:

1. Keep `supabase/schema.sql` and migration files in sync.
2. Tell the user which migration files to run (filename order, oldest first).
3. User applies SQL manually in **Supabase Dashboard → SQL Editor**.
